      "GINGER: Brigitte. Quit dickin' around. Jus' do it.\nBRIGITTE: Ginger's ten months older than me. We're seriously tight. share everything. Everything.\nBRIGITTE: Ready?\nGINGER: Uh-huh.",
      "BRIGITTE: Don't get me wrong. It's not like we were all happy or nothin' to begin with.\nBRIGITTE: The subnrb of Bailey Downs? Basically a well lit black hole. The Kingdom of cul du sac. That's French for Dead End.\nBRIGITTE: You had a gram of personality out here? Life bit the big one.\nBRIGITTE: Of course I'm generalizing.",
      "GINGER: Means there's more to life than - well, life.\nBRIGITTE: Attempts at communication were futile.\nBRIGITTE: some of Them did seem to wanna reach Ginger?\nBRIGITTE: Uut noOOdy wanned to reach me.",
      "GINGER: Gawd, People! They hurt my brain!\nBRIGITTE: They didn't even get it.\nGINGER: They' re retards.\nBRIGITTE: They're cretins.",
      "MZ.SYKES: shake a leg, Fitzgeralds. An' butt out, you gotta death wish!?\nGINGER: Feel really sick, Mz. Sykes.\nMZ. SYKES: cigarettes'll do that for you! Move!\nBRIGITTE: Phys. Ed. is not optional at Bailey High."
    ]
  },
